  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A battery of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> is connected to the circuit as shown below. The current <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math> drawn from the battery is</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0129_31255e870761.png\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 199px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The given circuit in the question is a case of a balanced Wheatstone bridge. Therefore, the circuit can be simplified as given below.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0129_ab4a33e8a458.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 160px;\" /></p><p>The equivalent resistance for the given circuit will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>eq</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, the current supplied by the battery is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}